flowchart LR
  A["cacheable miss for key K"] --> B["count K in the frequency sketch<br/>(fixed memory, W-TinyLFU)"]
  B --> C("freq(K) ≥ threshold + size bonus?<br/>threshold default 2 · +1 per 256 KiB")
  C -- "no" --> D["render, serve, do not store"]
  C -- "yes" --> E["render, serve, STORE"]
  D -- "next request" --> A
